---
title: "Jaane Tu Yaa Jaane Naa"
artist: "Bollywood"
key: "G"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

{c: Verse}

[G]Tu bole [C]glass aadha [Bm7]khali,

[Em]mein bolu [C]aadha bhara,

[G]Mein bolu [Em]kitna [Am]saara

[C]tu bole, [Am]zara zara..

[Cm]Mein bolu [C7]din hai to,

[Gm]tu bole [F#7]raat nahi..

[Cm]Baat to [C7]wahi hain aa,

[Gm]Bas wahi [F#7]baat nahi..

[G]Baat to hai bas [Am7]yahi ki,

[G]Meri [Am]baat [D]bas..

{c: Chorus}

[G] Jaane tu..[B7]jaane tu ya [Am]jaane [C6]naa..[D#]

[G]Maane tu..[F#7]maane tu ya [Am]maane [C6]naa..[G#] -[2 times]

Saxophone part:

[G]..[B7]..[Am7]..[D#]..[G]..[F#7]..[Am7]..[G#]..[Em]..[C]..[Am]..[D#]..[Em]..[Bm]..[Am]..[D#]..[G]

Rest of the song is same.

Chords Used-

F#7-xx4352

C7-x32310

B7-x21203

Am7-x02010

C6-x32210

